<title>CROATIA: TABLE-Croatia June retail sales fall 0.6 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Croatia June retail sales fall 0.6 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL SALES     JUNE 97     MAY 97    JUNE 96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	-0.6	  4.1	  n/a</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)	   9.5	  8.9	  n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Some 500 leading retailers, representing more than half of the total domestic trade sector, forecast a 4.4 percent rise in retail sales in July. They had forecast a 2.9 percent rise for June.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Smith, Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
